{"id": "1544138127474434078", "channel_id": "1543760297637187614", "author_id": "264894122148495362", "author_name": "sirtealot", "content": "- There's no Easy mode, it starts with Normal <:Fkeeper_peak:1468258784051859684> \n- The issue with level gap is not that Hard is too hard, but the lack of in-between difficulty options, which previous system handled much better \n- There's nothing wrong with meaningful extra rewards for clearing Nightmare as an incentive to work towards being able to clear it, but emergency gnosis in DTide should not be a thing, as it promotes bashing your head against the content you can't actually clear for the sake of rewards and creates an avenue for BIAV to disregard the balance of encounters, using revives as an excuse \n- Main issues with GHelot boss are fervor stacks and overtuned HP numbers, rest is manageable", "timestamp": "2026-09-01T00:13:38.289000+00:00", "type": 19, "thread_id": "1543760297637187614", "mentions": ["464442234041925632"], "reply_to": "1544134818051133601", "thread_title": "D-tide feedback", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1542484945447026708", "1542479601241030726"]}
